// Title: Add Windows Capability Via PowerShell Cmdlet
// ID: b36d01a3-ddaf-4804-be18-18a6247adfcd
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2023-01-22
// Tags: attack.execution
// Description: Detects usage of the "Add-WindowsCapability" cmdlet to add Windows capabilities. Notable capabilities could be "OpenSSH" and others.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "OpenSSH.")) AND (where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "Add-WindowsCapability")) AND (((where(Image IENDSWITH "\\powershell.exe") OR where(Image IENDSWITH "\\pwsh.exe"))) OR ((where(OriginalFileName = "PowerShell.EXE") OR where(OriginalFileName = "pwsh.dll")))))
